cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Attractor Compass"
abstract: >-
  Scores a French political text on the two attractor axes of Bruno Latour's
  Où atterrir ? (2017) — Local↔Global and Hors-Sol↔Terrestre — with a cosine
  SemAxis projection blended with zero-shot NLI stance. Ships the Wordscores
  lexical baseline and a reproducible benchmark.
